{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"5033","title":"Xiaomi SU7 Ultra Shatters Electric Executive Vehicle Lap Record at Nürburgring Nordschleife with Blistering 7:04.957","desc":"The Fastest Production Electric Executive Vehicle in Nürburgring History","view_cnt":"19499","like_cnt":"7","add_time":"1749566235","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/797_operatorx_operatorx_opx/10/06/2025/222134f5a6a93e677ed59fcb62b1536c.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/760_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/10/06/2025/01cb3ff52093ac286ecb8347674451b1.jpg\" alt=\"Two electric cars are showcased at the Nurburgring track, with staff beside the silver and yellow models, and the background features the track and clouds. The record shows: 7'04\u0026quot;957, indicating that the Xiaomi SU7 Ultra has broken the record for electric executive vehicles.\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, June 11th, 2025\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e– Xiaomi Auto today announced an historic achievement: its Xiaomi SU7 Ultra production model has set the Fastest Electric Executive Vehicle record at the Nürburgring Nordschleife with a blistering lap time of 7:04.957 minutes. Equipped with the optional track package, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra conquered the legendary circuit on its first attempt, establishing itself as the undisputed leader in high-performance electric vehicles.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra’s ability to achieve this milestone lap time of 7:04.957 minutes is a testament to Xiaomi Auto’s relentless pursuit of track performance. Its extreme \"three core electric technologies\" (electric motor, power battery, and motor control unit), chassis torque-vectoring control, and aerodynamic design laid a solid foundation for this new record. The production model of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra implements track-proven engineering solutions, maintaining both the complete \"three core electric technologies\" (electric motor, power battery, and motor control unit) and the identical tri-motor configuration from Xiaomi SU7 Ultra Prototype. This powertrain setup, consisting of two V8s and one V6s e-motors, delivers a formidable combined maximum power output of 1,548 PS. Such engineering enables breathtaking acceleration from 0-100 km/h in as low as 1.98 seconds (with one foot rollout subtracted) and pushes the top speed beyond 350 km/h.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe racetrack is the ultimate test of technology and the birthplace of innovation. The sustained high-speed, high-temperature conditions of the track push EV powertrains to their limits. Behind this lap time lies Xiaomi Auto’s unwavering commitment to refining technology and enhancing vehicle quality, reliability, and safety.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/494_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/10/06/2025/729c481302955855b48ac0a3c45421e9.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;PingFang SC\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Hiragino Sans GB\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Microsoft YaHei\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \u0026quot;Apple Color Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;;\"\u003eNotably, Xiaomi \u003c/span\u003eAuto\u003cspan style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;PingFang SC\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Hiragino Sans GB\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Microsoft YaHei\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \u0026quot;Apple Color Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;;\"\u003e has recently reached a deep cooperation with the Nürburgring, becoming a premium partner of the Nürburgring. Moreover, a new \"Xiaomi Curve\" has been added to the Grand Prix track. At the same time, Xiaomi \u003c/span\u003eAuto\u003cspan style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;PingFang SC\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Hiragino Sans GB\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Microsoft YaHei\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \u0026quot;Apple Color Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;;\"\u003e is now a member of the Nürburgring’s test and development drives (commonly known as the Industry Pool). As part of its long-term commitment to innovation, Xiaomi \u003c/span\u003eAuto\u003cspan style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;PingFang SC\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Hiragino Sans GB\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Microsoft YaHei\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \u0026quot;Apple Color Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;;\"\u003e will leverage its Nürburgring partnership to accelerate EV development, using the legendary circuit as a proving ground for next-generation technologies that will redefine performance standards worldwide.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies. In March 2025, the MAU reached approximately 718.8 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 943.7 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of March 31, 2025. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to “Human × Car × Home” smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2024, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the sixth year in a row.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"2596","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1774495807"},"common":null}